{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1028114001:1":{"text":"もしかして、さっきの記憶に出てきたリーフベアーは、以前ロンロンたちが埋葬したあの……！？","source_cn":"难道说，刚才回忆里那只叶角熊，是我们之前埋葬的那只叶角...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAD714CAE728E7B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028114002:0":{"text":"……はい。あの子……エルゴンは、わたしの初めてのお友だちです。","source_cn":"……是的。它……伊尔贡，是我的第一个朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33146AE71948BF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028114003:0":{"text":"優しくて、モフモフで、少しドジだけど、とても勇敢だったんですよ。ハチミツが大好きで、私のことをとても信頼してくれてて……","source_cn":"它很温柔，毛绒绒的，有一点点憨厚，可是很勇敢，最喜欢吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A5C2BC7F5B8C4FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028114004:0":{"text":"でも今回は、治療が間に合わなかった……わたし……","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028114004":{"text":"でも今回は、治療が間に合わなかった……わたし……","source_cn":"可这次，我没能来得及治好它……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFB6FCD9C6CB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028114007:1":{"text":"イヴォンヌさん、エルゴンはずっとあなたの記憶のなかで生き続けますよ。","source_cn":"伊温小姐，它永远都会在你的记忆里陪着你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B73E3AF0C6A060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028114008:1":{"text":"心があまーく感じたときは、きっとその子がハチミツをごちそうしてくれてるんですよ！","source_cn":"要是你哪天突然感到心头一甜，没准就是它在请你吃蜂蜜呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC125D2E74BBF5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028114009:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます。ゆっくりと、受け止めていきたいと思います……","source_cn":"谢谢你们的安慰，我会慢慢走出悲伤的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F706ABC26839092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028114010:0":{"text":"力が少しずつ回復してきました。最後の魔力も無事に回収できるといいのですが……","source_cn":"我的力量也开始恢复了，希望能顺利回收最后一处散逸的魔力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB4B227EA3F4A9CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028114011:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌさん、次の記憶のかけらの媒体は何ですか？","source_cn":"伊温小姐，这次需要什么样的物品来激活记忆碎片呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9506BC13DC1A53B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn